SUMMARY:Discovering Herbal Allies Workshop Series
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n***When:*** Saturd
 ay - November 14th\; 10am-11am\n***Where:*** Unity Holistic Wellness Cente
 r\, Inc. - 5124 Departure Dr. Ste 108\; Raleigh\, NC\n***Fees:*** $10 - $2
 0\n***Register/Pay Here:*** [unityholisticwellnesscenter.org](www.unityhol
 isticwellnesscenter.org)\n***Herbal Allies Series #3*** with Herbalist / E
 volving Astrologer LeAnna Cargman is in full swing\, and next up is the he
 rb Cinnamon! In this workshop\, we’ll learn about the different versions
  of this ever-popular herb (with lots of copycats)\, why they aren’t equ
 al and which ones are worthy medicine for your apothecaries. And we’ll d
 ive deep into all of the usual fun stuff -- how it’s harvested\, where c
 innamon hails from and all the lore and fun facts! [Grab your spot here](w
 ww.unityholisticwellnesscenter.org)\n\n***We hope your Fall season is full
  of magic and gratitude.... join us!***
