SUMMARY:Paths to Open Contact: Living with ETs\, Angels\, Faeries and Spir
 it Guides
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nIt’s an exciting
  time to be alive on planet Earth! Are you feeling the love yet? If not do
 n’t worry\, you can get the healing help you need to leave old fear and 
 pain behind. The future of dreams is predestined and underway\, including 
 everyone's freewill to delay their own happiness as long as they choose on
  their own timeline. The realities are splitting because they've always be
 en split. People just like to cluster for the company. So if you've had en
 ough of hells\, rest assured the seeds of paradise are growing for the mos
 t magical 2027. I know because Spirit has trained me my whole life\, and t
 his October was especially clear. Even before the game-changing US mid-ter
 m elections\, my ET partner was filling me in on the plan. Since I’m a l
 ife-long fan of Star Trek\, we met with Gene Roddenberry the day before Pa
 trick Stewart passed into Spirit to help Gene more from there. So join us 
 this Sunday Nov 8\, 2026 for a free eye-heart-mind opening talk on how to 
 get more involved in the greatest show on Earth. It's YOU living happy eve
 r after!\n\nIt matters not if you’re new or old to the ascension game. T
 here's no seniority for how much the Universe loves you\, which is totally
  forever. All that’s required is your own willingness to believe in your
 self. Deep down you know that you were made for greatness in your own most
  satisfying way. As they say\, God doesn't make junk. Or call it Goddess\,
  Great Spirit\, Creator\, Source\, All That Is\, Big Hug\, whatever works 
 for you. There's an unconditional universal love throughout the infinite m
 ultiverse that supports your consciousness to create its own reality. 100%
 \, never fails. This means that everyone is their own everything\, so asce
 nsion is about becoming the creator in the creation. The creation was alre
 ady in the creator\, so now is time to create your life even as you live i
 t\, in person most deliciously. No more waiting to die to go to heaven. Yo
 u're here to make heaven on the Earth.\n\nFor many years now -- and for ce
 nturies under different terminologies -- you've been wishfully taught to h
 ope for full disclosure in the time of open contact. The higher beings wil
 l come to live among us with the many gifts we need to heal and guide the 
 planet forward for the new golden age of miracles and peace. Angels\, ETs\
 , ascended masters\, nature spirits\, ancestors and more. From ghost dance
 s to raptures\, UFO landings to kundalini awakenings\, the glorious predic
 tions have been for many too slow and disappointing. But that's because th
 e nature of the consciousness shift was bigger than could be yet comprehen
 ded. Jesus said\, “Greater things than these you will do.” The very na
 ture of reality must be re-imagined as the negative ego is returned to its
  proper place. Shadow work comes in both dark and light forms\, as love be
 came more feared than fear itself. The endless war between good and evil m
 ust not only end forever\, both inside and out. It must never have begun.\
 n\nWhat may seem impossible is inevitable in the eternal now where you lea
 rn to love yourself. You are a two-part being\, part human and part spirit
 . The human being adapts to survive in time and space under beliefs that s
 eem utterly real and unchangeable\, while the spirit thrives in simultaneo
 us time where the beliefs are yours to chose for being either true and pos
 itive or false and negative. Your goal was never to change the world or ot
 her people to build a paradise. You’re here in processes to change yours
 elf\, to experience more of the paradise that you're already from. As such
 \, you don't need to predict when the UFOs will land on Earth. There are n
 o conspiracies to fear\, nobody’s blocking you. You alone can guarantee 
 to yourself when you will land where the UFOs are already waiting for you.
 \n\nFor this meetup\, review your hopes and fears around higher beings gui
 ding the world and you. Does logic get in your way\, do you struggle to re
 concile heart and mind? Is your inner parent critical of your inner child
 ’s imagination\, or have you had experiences that defy integration? My s
 pirit team and I will outline our view of the great ascension plan for hum
 an evolution\, with emphasis on personal empowerment. Predictions and fact
 oids are weak compared to personal experience\, so I’ll share in ways de
 signed to explain and inspire more than impress. I’ll recap my starseed 
 journey from first Earth incarnation to my recent Mantis meeting on Star T
 rek versus Star Wars. We’ll see how to work with angels\, ETs\, fairies\
 , and more\, and conclude with a love centered guided meditation.\n\nWelco
 me! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free online every 
 Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided meditation. 
 If you can’t stay you can get the recording. You can signup here for thi
 s meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, newsletter\, videos
 \, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selves Mastery
 \nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at www.signupISM.com
