SUMMARY:Salsa & Bachata Night @ Komana Brewery in Cary 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🔥 SALSA4LIFE WE
 DNESDAYS 🔥\nSALSA • BACHATA • MERENGUE • LATIN HITS\nCary’s Wed
 nesday night Latin dance social is where the community comes together to D
 ANCE! 💃🏽🕺🏽\n🔥 WEEKLY LATIN DANCE SOCIAL\n🔥 BEGINNER-FRIE
 NDLY DANCE LESSON\n🔥 SPACIOUS DANCE FLOOR\n🔥 COOL A/C + COMFORTABLE 
 DANCE SPACE + FANS\n🔥 DRINK SPECIALS 🍻\n🔥 FREE PARKING\n🔥 DOOR
  PRIZE GIVEAWAYS 🎁\n🔥 COME SOLO OR BRING YOUR CREW\n🔥 GREAT MUSIC
  • GREAT PEOPLE • LATIN DANCING\nWhether you're brand new to Latin dan
 cing or you've been dancing Salsa and Bachata for years\, Salsa4Life Wedne
 sdays is your midweek dance destination!\nCome learn\, meet new people\, c
 onnect with the community\, and dance the night away. ❤️\n🔥 YOUR WE
 DNESDAY NIGHT PLANS ARE HERE! 🔥\n⏰ 7:15 PM — Doors open & meet-and-
 greet mixer\n💃🏽 7:30–8:30 PM — Salsa & Bachata lesson\n🎁 Afte
 r class — Free door prize giveaways\n🔥 8:30–11:00 PM — Social dan
 cing\n\n🕺 DJ Giovanni playing the best 🎶 Salsa\, Bachata\, Merengue 
 and Latin Hits.\n📍 KōMANA Brewing Company\n1020 Ryan Road\, Cary\, NC\
 n💵 $10 online and b4 9pm\nTickets: salsa4life.com\n\n🍻 Drink special
 s available\nNo partner needed. All levels welcome.\n18+ to party • 21+ 
 to drink\n\n🔥 MAKE WEDNESDAY YOUR NEW FAVORITE NIGHT TO DANCE!\n📤 SH
 ARE with someone who needs more dancing in their life!\nHosted by Salsa4Li
 fe.com\n\n#Salsa4Life #Salsa4LifeWednesdays #LatinDance #SalsaDancing #Bac
 hataDancing #Merengue #LatinMusic #CaryNC #RaleighNC #TriangleNC
